📋 CRITICAL: Backend Environment Variables

You MUST update backend environment variables in cPanel:

1. Go to: cPanel → Setup Node.js App → Your App
2. Click: 'Environment Variables' or 'Edit'
3. Set these variables with LIVE keys:

   RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_live_RhWOsPuVUOT0Xx
   RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=(your-live-secret-key)
   RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=(your-live-webhook-secret)

⚠️  IMPORTANT:
   - Keys MUST start with 'rzp_live_' (NOT 'rzp_test_')
   - After updating, click 'Save'
   - Then click 'Restart App'
   - Wait 10-30 seconds for app to restart

4. Verify Razorpay Dashboard:
   - Go to: https://dashboard.razorpay.com/
   - Check top-right corner says 'Live Mode' (not 'Test Mode')
   - Go to: Settings → API Keys
   - Make sure you're viewing 'Live Mode' keys

5. Test:
   - Clear browser cache (Ctrl+Shift+Delete)
   - Visit: https://theonerupeerevolution.org/donate
   - Try making a donation
   - Payment page should NOT show 'TEST MODE'

